<title>GERMANY: RWE says expects higher 1996/97 results.</title>
<headline>RWE says expects higher 1996/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>ESSEN, Germany 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified energy group reaffirmed on Thursday that it expected to post higher results for its 1996/97 business year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>RWE had said in November that it expected net earnings to continue to improve in the current business year after reporting a group net profit of 180 million marks ($116.6 million) for the three-month period in its first quarter of the business year from July to September.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525 ($ = 1.543 German Marks)</p>
